Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.41,0:01:42.05,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H8E6B6C&\3c&HDAC0B8&)}{\t(458,917,1,\1c&H4B251B&\3c&H7D645E&)}{\t(1626,2002,1,\1c&H9C6687&\3c&HE8D9F0&)}{\t(2460,2752,1,\1c&HC9838A&\3c&HE6C6C9&)}{\t(3713,4004,1,\1c&H93464D&\3c&HF7C8C2&)}{\t(5297,5881,1,\1c&H1C8AF6&\3c&HBCD8F9&)}用思念回憶著　這份溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:49.75,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H3B343E&\3c&HE2EDF5&}{\t(320,361,1,\1c&H3D464A&\3c&H408141&)}{\t(778,1738,1,\1c&HC28147&\3c&HE9B997&)}{\t(2614,3781,1,\1c&H625A2B&\3c&HA7C08C&)}{\t(4324,4365,1,\1c&H8C77C0&\3c&HC5BBE9&)}{\t(5825,5867,1,\1c&HE96B0E&\3c&HF4AD4F&)}唯有你　唯有你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.83,0:01:55.96,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&}{\t(1782,2950,1,\1c&H5C3C08&\3c&HA09D6D&)}{\t(3534,3575,1,\1c&H6C5C6B&\3c&HB8A5B1&)}{\t(4827,4868,1,\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&)}我一直喜歡著你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.05,0:02:03.56,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H7C2506&\3c&HD76923&}{\t(776,817,1,\1c&H5F4E46&\3c&HA49288&)}{\t(858,1883,1,\1c&H459BEF&\3c&H60C2F6&)}{\t(2611,3779,1,\1c&H554E76&\3c&H9EA6DC&)}{\t(4237,4279,1,\1c&H459BEF&\3c&H60C2F6&)}{\t(5739,5781,1,\1c&H4F4753&\3c&H9F76A6&)}風沙起　眼迷離
