Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:17.24,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&HA04C67&\3c&H6992CA&}{\t(835,1210,1,\1c&H7D788D&\3c&HCECFDD&)}唯有那件　唯有那件
